          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पालन करना (pālan karnā) joins पालन to करना, \"to do\". पालन is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit pālana, \"guarding, protecting\" (Monier-Williams). Hindi uses it for keeping to a rule."
            }
          ]
